# Pests of Honor ({2}{W}, 2/2): "Celebration — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if two or more nonland permanents entered
# the battlefield under your control this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" (CR 207.2c, 603.4). On turn three the Pests
# are the only nonland permanent to enter (the Mox Pearl of turn one is another turn's), so no counter: still 2/2 at turn five.
# On turn five a Memnite and an Ornithopter are exactly two, so one counter: 3/3 at turn seven. On turn seven a Memnite alone is
# one (and a Plains is no nonland permanent), so no counter: still 3/3 at turn nine.

